  "title": "STRANGER OF PARADISE FINAL FANTASY ORIGIN",
  "description": "In this hard-core action RPG, Jack must hazard numerous challenges to bring the light of the crystals back to Cornelia, a kingdom conquered by darkness.",
  "longDescription": "## About the Game\n\nWith the memory of their struggle buried deep in their hearts...\n\nFight your way through fierce battles with a variety of means to defeat your enemies. With multiple difficulty options and a wide selection of jobs and weapons available to customize your party, you can choose exactly how you want to play.\n\nWill restoring the crystals' light usher in peace or a new form of darkness? ...Or perhaps something else entirely?\n\n## Pre-Purchase now to get all the bonuses!\n\nPre-Purchase Bonuses\n(Valid until 11:59 p.m. on March 17, 2022)\n • 24-hour early access: Start playing from 12:00 a.m. on March 17\n • Braveheart weapon and Lustrous Shield\n\nEarly-Purchase Bonus\n(Valid until 11:59 p.m. on April 18, 2022)\n • Rebellion weapon\n\n*Players who pre-purchase will also receive the early-purchase bonus Rebellion weapon.\n\n*This product is the standard edition. All contents of the standard edition are also included in the Digital Deluxe Edition, which is a separate product.\n\n",
